    <string name="t_foot1" formatted="false">These numbers are not measurements. SolarCast downloads the forecast radiation components (direct, diffuse and global) and projects them onto the plane of each of your strings, then converts to output using your capacity, system efficiency and panel temperature. The tilt projection uses an isotropic sky model with 20 % ground albedo.</string>
